  <item>
    <title>VOL50. 哄自己上班，也哄自己生活</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/68ecf148224325ea7008fb01</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">68ecf148224325ea7008fb01</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 13 Oct 2025 12:36:36 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>上班让我们精疲力尽，也让我们看清自己。</span></p><span></span><p><span>来吧，在“上班”与“生活”的缝隙间，</span></p><span></span><p><span>一起聊聊清醒、发疯、以及如何温柔地哄哄自己。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="210">03:30</a>无痛起床</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="488">08:08</a>优化的苦恼</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="615">10:15</a>无意义的周报</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="709">11:49</a>有人的地方就有复杂的政治人际关系</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1225">20:25</a>上班是不会穿好看衣服的</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1309">21:49</a>我悟了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1625">27:05</a>上班，哄哄自己吧</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/671c7c5195c464ad44a5707b/lpJ43irNvDCDrA_ZStQ3aswdw7C_.m4a" length="30884495" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:37:45</itunes:duration>
