  <item>
    <title>VOL49.在混乱与拥挤中，我们依然找到了生活的趣味。</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/68e39baf8e321a0d6f16e925</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">68e39baf8e321a0d6f16e925</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 06 Oct 2025 16:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>这个十一假期，我们谁都没逃过——人山人海、丧尸围城、被塞在高速的灵魂拷问。人挤人，心挤心，有人在堵车，有人在疗愈。</span></p><span></span><p><span>这一期，我们聊点生活的荒诞与温柔。</span></p><span></span><p><span>有混乱，也有宁静；有疲惫，也有笑意。</span></p><span></span><p><span>假期不止于度过，也在于感受。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="32">00:32</a>十一假期犹如丧尸围城</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="521">08:41</a>孩子是我最好的玩伴</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1019">16:59</a>谁说看家装杂志不算是一种装修呢</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1093">18:13</a>谦卑和真诚好难呀</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1240">20:40</a>绝经之后=好日子要来了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1500">25:00</a>技能五与子棋就是快乐的真谛</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1819">30:19</a>职业运动员该何去何从</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2290">38:10</a>不沉迷网络小技巧</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2485">41:25</a>好心态决定好人生：被绑去缅北诈骗园区，我没有放弃我自己</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/671c7c5195c464ad44a5707b/lhZBUW92Iz17s8iQxljOz7G1Z0dF.m4a" length="38426809" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:46:29</itunes:duration>
