  <item>
    <title>VOL41.坦白局！你的guilty pleasure是什么？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/68999f2b20a2906a4df56e9b</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">68999f2b20a2906a4df56e9b</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 11 Aug 2025 16:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>快乐有两种：一种是高级的，一种是打死不承认的！这期播客中，老蝴蝶狗主播们将集体自曝变态癖好，揭露自己最羞耻的快乐！有人的guilty pleasure竟然是……</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="87">1:27</a> 偷吃乱吃才美味</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="671">11:11</a> 低级趣味好解压</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1263">21:03</a> 就想乱花钱怎么办？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1589">26:29</a> 脚趾扣地的怪癖</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1735">28:55</a>看热闹的果然不嫌事大</span></p><span></span><p><span>听完这期你会发现，其实guilty pleasure是人类共有的秘密哦！如果快乐也分三六九等，那世界未免太无趣了。审美无高下，快乐本无罪。是社会规训、精英人设、审美霸凌给我们无伤大雅的小癖好套上枷锁。</span></p><span></span><p><span>让我们消除罪恶感，把你的guilty pleasure写在评论区，让它正大光明晒太阳，做个理直气壮的快乐人！</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/671c7c5195c464ad44a5707b/lul86oR89PbZC8SgA0t6gsiZJCZp.m4a" length="30757808" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:36:30</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FrxfYwVE9z9MhCve_VNm3w9YZFKD.jpg"/>
